│ as a sequence of pattern characters, where two different values must be      │
│ allowed to share the same pattern character.                                 │
│                                                                              │
│                                                                              │
│ Clarification question: Must the input sequence and the pattern have exactly │
│ the same length, and should the function return false (not error) if they    │
│ differ?                                                                      │
